{"w":7029,"lines":[{"text":"St. Matthew 5: 3-10","y":0.86918604680556522,"conf":1,"w":0.33016625936929278,"x":0.30878860664042995,"h":0.021802325097341368},{"x":0.33831377413167879,"w":0.27113183752282871,"y":0.81778756909412142,"h":0.030290491997249536,"text":"December 12, 1943","conf":1},{"x":0.087567610183948569,"text":"\"Blessed are the poor in spirit, for theirs is the kingdom of","conf":1,"y":0.77974336846255765,"w":0.79626350898247278,"h":0.027077125178442962},{"h":0.014915631877051472,"text":"heaven.","conf":1,"x":0.06130920906649346,"y":0.7687027394680791,"w":0.10316633868527103},{"w":0.76765218957678061,"text":"\"Blessed are those who mourn, for they shall be comforted.","y":0.74255295486336048,"x":0.090028331106585299,"h":0.023527860641479492,"conf":1},{"y":0.72259109897893803,"text":"\"Blessed are the meek, for they shall inherit the earth.","x":0.089937329410970185,"w":0.69418879917689724,"conf":1,"h":0.024579337665012857},{"conf":1,"x":0.090053016591034638,"w":0.79134819724343053,"h":0.023887571834382504,"text":"\"Blessed are those who hunger and thirst for righteousness, for","y":0.70327187940753699},{"h":0.018929955505189389,"text":"they shall be satisfied.","y":0.68601190430892189,"x":0.064133015687423495,"w":0.27790973712871603,"conf":1},{"w":0.68451155625380478,"text":"\"Blessed are the merciful, for they shall obtain mercy.","x":0.090039233469494009,"h":0.023473604330940923,"y":0.66263512295825078,"conf":1},{"text":"\"Blessed are the pure in heart, for they shall see God.","x":0.089898902234721384,"y":0.64225281000494849,"w":0.68473142153256894,"h":0.025008931992545946,"conf":1},{"x":0.089991611328774077,"w":0.79142250952782567,"conf":1,"y":0.62229035871857385,"h":0.024616194149804538,"text":"\"Blessed are the peacemakers, for they shall be called sons"},{"y":0.60808866107687209,"conf":1,"x":0.061382004053886371,"h":0.017834305763244629,"text":"of God.","w":0.10051390412565948},{"conf":1,"y":0.58276691546500758,"x":0.089930204785330592,"w":0.79169919893339102,"h":0.028297030736529671,"text":"\"Blessed are those who are persecuted for righteousness' sake,"},{"h":0.020406514879256932,"conf":1,"text":"for theirs is the kingdom of heaven.\"","x":0.061757727155561479,"y":0.565406976892737,"w":0.47030877447747554},{"text":"THe essential meaning of the beatitudes is their implication","conf":1,"y":0.5305059524604625,"h":0.021825396825396859,"w":0.81710211023107748,"x":0.061757730988974371},{"h":0.02038921155626805,"y":0.50868055547126079,"x":0.061757727646592327,"w":0.81710211023107759,"text":"of a promise. For this reason they form a most suitable text","conf":1},{"text":"for the season of Advent; for the Advent message is the mess-","conf":1,"x":0.059382447244159052,"w":0.82185269640637681,"y":0.48685515827255199,"h":0.02041228328432354},{"h":0.020585317460317443,"conf":1,"y":0.46354166677001185,"text":"age of a promise. A promise for those who are oppressed by","x":0.059382430122227547,"w":0.82185269640637681},{"y":0.44186046551676794,"w":0.81710211023107748,"h":0.020441121525234585,"x":0.061757740292220496,"conf":1,"text":"adversity and cry aloud for help; for those who \"walk in"},{"text":"darkness\" and long for light. To all such the promise rings","conf":1,"x":0.061757718199911424,"y":0.41860465158650384,"w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.021871539335402201},{"text":"out: \"Blessed are ye!\" \"Salvation will be yours!\" For to","w":0.81947742808948865,"y":0.39533730165997594,"conf":1,"x":0.061757731204661742,"h":0.021825396825396748},{"y":0.37351190435152581,"h":0.020383444097306969,"w":0.81947742808948854,"x":0.059382415854305821,"text":"them the future is to bring help and healing; they are to be","conf":1},{"y":0.35019841311445798,"x":0.059382424722248368,"w":0.82660333212319903,"h":0.021894610117352276,"conf":1,"text":"comforted and filled; they are to see God; the kingdom of"},{"w":0.22327789702972803,"x":0.059382431888936348,"y":0.32986111153499287,"text":"heaven is theirs.","conf":1,"h":0.01909722222222221},{"w":0.78384795746245939,"h":0.021900377576313357,"conf":1,"text":"Do we belong to the circle of those to whom these promises","y":0.30523255865409105,"x":0.095011885698699075},{"h":0.02184270014838563,"text":"apply? Among the beatitudes there is one by which we feel","conf":1,"y":0.2819767443463147,"x":0.061757728376147798,"w":0.81710211023107748},{"conf":1,"text":"particularly moved to-day, and which we wish had been","y":0.25825661396551969,"w":0.81983521696809047,"x":0.059171212773997929,"h":0.024648761938488639},{"conf":1,"y":0.2368551587876665,"h":0.021865770930335593,"text":"addressed directly to ourselves: \"Blessed are those who","x":0.059382432651682263,"w":0.81710211023107737},{"conf":1,"x":0.059382428027702126,"y":0.21354166691335941,"w":0.81947742808948876,"h":0.023376937896486316,"text":"mourn, for they shall be comforted!\" For who is there among"},{"conf":1,"w":0.81710211023107748,"h":0.021802325097341479,"y":0.19186046563083503,"x":0.061757728376147798,"text":"us who to-day is not a mourner, longing for some comfort?"},{"conf":1,"y":0.16860465160203941,"w":0.81710211023107748,"h":0.020383444097306969,"x":0.06175774165405732,"text":"Perhaps some of us have recently heard these words sung to"},{"y":0.14680232604144561,"x":0.059382438020089627,"conf":1,"text":"the music of Brahms' Requiem and were moved to tears.","h":0.021848467607346822,"w":0.82185269640637693},{"text":"But may we isolate any one of the beatitudes and apply it","h":0.025606376784188312,"y":0.12130783382751897,"x":0.06158434219646005,"w":0.81985102071390525,"conf":1},{"y":0.10019841267014351,"conf":1,"w":0.82422801426478809,"text":"specially to ourselves in this way? They belong integrally","h":0.023348098709469745,"x":0.057007124767843677},{"x":0.44893111787393292,"text":"20I","y":0.079941860603798043,"conf":1,"h":0.011627906844729474,"w":0.047505936065277476}],"page":197,"h":11508}